- Geographical locations may belong to specific administrative regions or countries; identify these correctly.
- When multiple paragraphs contain related information about a single entity, integrate these details to provide a complete answer.
- Avoid introducing any external information not contained within the provided paragraphs.

The goal is to deliver a focused, factual answer that demonstrates comprehension and synthesis of the provided text in relation to the question asked.
